@startuml SD-30-confirm-roster-warnings
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor black
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBorderColor black
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor white
skinparam EntityBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBorderColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam dpi 150
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceActorFontSize 12
autonumber
title SD-30: Confirm Roster Warnings (UC-07)
' Traces: UC-07; FR-45, FR-53, FR-55, FR-66, FR-71
' Sources: DEC-04, DEC-19, DEC-32, DEC-43, DEC-55, DEC-56; sequence-diagram-review.md.
control ":Roster\nController" as RC
control ":Rule\nValidator" as RV
entity ":Staff" as ST

[-> RC ++ : confirmWarnings(context)
RC -> RV ++ : checkWarnings(context)
RV -> ST ++ : workload(week)
ST --> RV -- : existing hours
RV -> RV : proposedWorkload(context, hours)
RV --> RC -- : warnings / none
alt warnings raised
  RC -->] : warnings for Manager
  [-> RC : confirmWarningChoice(choice)
  RC -->] : override / cancel
else no warnings
  RC -->] : proceed
end
deactivate RC
legend bottom
Warning/choice gates connect to the Manager through
JobAllocationPage in SD-07.
FR-45: proposed Workload above 40 h, Job Preference, customer Slot,
fewer than 3 Vans, incomplete Standby.
This fragment saves nothing. Callers save and log overrides only
after confirmation.
endlegend
@enduml
